abstract: "Multi-camera SOP sequence monitoring on HA-ViD: frozen DINOv2 features, one causal MS-TCN++ per view, learned precedence checks, an online deviation monitor with human review; one pre-registered held-out evaluation; every reported number recomputable from committed tables."
